{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"gruvbox-paper","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Gruvbox Paper","description":"The light side of Gruvbox.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Gruvbox Paper","path":"themes/gruvbox-paper.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/gruvbox-paper.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Gruvbox Paper\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fbf1c7\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#3c3836\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#d5c4a1\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d5c4a1\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#f2e5bc\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#d5c4a1\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#b57614\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#b57614\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#b57614\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d5c4a1\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#d5c4a180\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#b57614\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#d5c4a1\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#9d0006\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#79740e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#b57614\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#9d0006\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#928374\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79740e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8f3f71\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9d0006\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b57614\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79740e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8f3f71\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#076678\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9d0006\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b57614\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#af3a03\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Gruvbox Paper\n\nThe light side of Gruvbox.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Gruvbox Paper** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nColors from the Gruvbox palette by Pavel Pertsev (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fbf1c7` |\n| Text | `#3c3836` |\n| Accent | `#b57614` |\n| Keywords | `#9d0006` |\n| Strings | `#79740e` |\n| Functions | `#79740e` |\n| Types | `#b57614` |\n| Comments | `#928374` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}